udity and lets victims sue their creators, will go to Governor Walz for his signature.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366388</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-18-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-18-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Ethereum Foundation Sells $23 Million More in ETH to Tom Lee&#39;s BitMine</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366385/ethereum-foundation-sells-23-million-more-eth-tom-lee-bitmine</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 18:55:21 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>For the second straight week, the Ethereum Foundation has unloaded 10,000 ETH—about $23 million worth—to top treasury firm, BitMine.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366385</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-06-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-06-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Doctors Use AI to Spot &#39;Hidden&#39; Sperm In Men</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366374/doctors-ai-hidden-sperm-men-study</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 18:39:04 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Columbia University Fertility Center&#39;s Star method uses artificial intelligence to detect rare sperm missed in standard tests.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366374</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/doctor-decrypt-style-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/doctor-decrypt-style-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI&#39;s GPT-5.5 Matches Claude Mythos in Cyberattack Capabilities: AI Security Institute</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366371/openais-gpt-55-matches-claude-mythos-cyberattack-ai-security-institute</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 17:56:55 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>OpenAI&#39;s GPT-5.5 is the second AI system to complete a simulated corporate network intrusion end-to-end, raising alarms.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366371</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-crime-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-crime-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"998\" width=\"1775\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Pentagon Signs AI Deals With Google, OpenAI, Nvidia, Microsoft, Amazon and SpaceX</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366351/pentagon-ai-deals-google-openai-nvidia-microsoft-amazon-spacex</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 17:22:53 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Department of Defense&#39;s agreements will enable AI from the likes of Google and OpenAI to run on top-secret military networks.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366351</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-pete-hegseth-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-pete-hegseth-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Riot Platforms Stock Pops as Bitcoin Miner Reports Data Center Revenue, Doubled AMD Deal</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366347/riot-stock-pops-bitcoin-miner-data-center-revenue-doubled-amd-deal</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 16:10:35 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Bitcoin mining company&#39;s pivot to AI infrastructure hosting generated its first data center revenue as AMD expanded its capacity.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366347</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bitcoin-mining-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bitcoin-mining-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Ethereum ETFs Shed $184M Over 4-Day Negative Streak</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366343/ethereum-etfs-shed-184m-over-4-day-negative-streak</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 15:47:39 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Outflows from Ethereum ETFs extended to a 4-day streak as Bitcoin funds shed $490 million, even as the S&amp;#038;P 500 hit an all-time high.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Akash Girimath</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366343</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-08-scaled-gID_7.jpeg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Coins</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-08-scaled-gID_7.jpeg\" height=\"1440\" width=\"2560\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>MoonPay Launches Debit Mastercard That Lets AI Agents Pay With Stablecoins</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366341/moonpay-launches-debit-mastercard-ai-agents-pay-stablecoins</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 15:16:44 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>MoonPay’s new debit Mastercard lets autonomous AI agents spend stablecoins at any online Mastercard merchant.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366341</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-10-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-10-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Tether Reports Billion-Dollar Q1 Profit Amid Crypto Slump—And Says Audit Has Begun</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366324/tether-reports-billion-dollar-profit-amid-crypto-slump-audit-begun</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 15:03:07 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Stablecoin giant Tether says it holds over $141 billion in U.S. Treasuries, a figure that has never been verified by a full audit.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Sander Lutz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366324</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Tether-decrypt-style-03-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Tether-decrypt-style-03-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Dogecoin Hits 2-Month High as DOGE Mining Firm Plans to Go Public via Merger</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366320/dogecoin-2-month-high-doge-mining-firm-go-public</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 14:12:08 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Nasdaq-listed pharmaceutical company Shuttle pivots to crypto mining in first major institutional play for Dogecoin mining.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366320</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Doge4-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>dogecoin</category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Doge4-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Senators Warren, Wyden Quiz Commerce Secretary Lutnick Over Tether Loan to Children’s Trust</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366312/senators-warren-wyden-quiz-commerce-secretary-lutnick-over-tether-loan-to-childrens-trust</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 13:31:27 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The probe follows reports that Dynasty Trust A, which benefits Lutnick’s children, borrowed an undisclosed sum from the stablecoin issuer.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Will McCurdy</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366312</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/howard-lutnick-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/howard-lutnick-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Morning Minute: MegaETH&#39;s MEGA Debut Biggest of 2026</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366299/morning-minute-megaeths-mega-debut-biggest-of-2026</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 11:55:19 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>MegaETH just debuted the biggest token of 2026 to date, while Kalshi is now officially a top-five U.S. sportsbook.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Tyler Warner</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366299</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-megaeth-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Opinion</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-megaeth-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Closes April Up 12% as Strategy&#39;s MSTR Posts First Positive Month Since July</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366297/bitcoin-closes-april-up-12-as-strategys-mstr-posts-first-positive-month-since-july</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 11:47:53 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Bitcoin rallied 12% in April as Strategy added $4.1 billion in BTC, but on-chain data suggests gains may be speculative.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Akash Girimath</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366297</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bitcoin-decrypt-style-30-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Coins</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bitcoin-decrypt-style-30-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>South Korean Court Lifts Bithumb&#39;s Six-Month Business Suspension</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366292/south-korean-court-lifts-bithumbs-six-month-business-suspension</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 10:32:10 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A Seoul court has reversed March sanctions that would have restricted the exchange&#39;s core functions over alleged compliance failures.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366292</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Judge-decrypt-style-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Judge-decrypt-style-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Mistral AI Drops New Open-Source Model. The Internet Is Not Impressed, Except for One Thing</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366275/mistral-ai-open-source-model-agents-internet-not-impressed</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 21:31:03 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Mistral Medium 3.5 is the rare Western entry in the open-source top tier, but it costs multiples more than Chinese rivals that beat it on benchmarks.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366275</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ai-agents-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ai-agents-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Elon Musk Says xAI Used OpenAI Models to Train Grok</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366274/elon-musk-xai-used-openai-models-train-grok</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 20:52:43 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The admission in federal court is a rare acknowledgment of the use of distillation techniques as AI firms compete to build more capable and cheaper models.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366274</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-elon-musk-5-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-elon-musk-5-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Crash Incoming? April Surge Was Built on Shaky Ground, Analysts Warn</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366267/bitcoin-crash-incoming-april-surge-built-shaky-ground-analysts-warn</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 20:30:19 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Analysts warn that the Bitcoin rally was fueled by speculative futures trading, mirroring conditions that preceded the 2022 crypto crash.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366267</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-27-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-27-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI Rolls Out Advanced Account Security for ChatGPT Users</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366262/openai-advanced-account-security-chatgpt-users</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 19:51:43 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>OpenAI&#39;s new opt-in security feature requires passkeys, limits recovery options, and excludes chats from training.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366262</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-openai-logo-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-openai-logo-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Ubuntu Linux Is Adding AI Features—Its Users Are Worried</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366247/ubuntu-linux-adding-ai-features-users-worried</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 19:33:26 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Canonical announced plans to bake AI into Linux&#39;s most popular distro. The community that chose Ubuntu specifically to avoid this kind of thing was not thrilled.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366247</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/decrypt-style-ai-robots-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/decrypt-style-ai-robots-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Senate Votes to Ban Senators and Staff From Using Prediction Markets</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366243/senate-votes-ban-senators-staff-using-prediction-markets</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 19:16:38 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>S. Res. 708 prohibits senators and staff from using prediction markets, and became effective immediately upon passage.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366243</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>North Korean Hackers Have Stolen $6 Billion in Crypto—Including 76% of 2026&#39;s Spoils: TRM</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366241/north-korean-hackers-stolen-6-billion-crypto-trm</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 18:42:53 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Pyongyang-linked hackers drained $577 million from two DeFi platforms in April, underscoring an escalating threat to crypto markets.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366241</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/dprk-north-korea-hacker-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/dprk-north-korea-hacker-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI Finally Explains Why ChatGPT Wouldn&#39;t Stop Talking About Goblins</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366197/openai-explains-chatgpt-mention-goblins</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 18:16:37 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Why did OpenAI have to write &#34;never mention goblins&#34; into its production code on ChatGPT? The company has published a post-mortem.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366197</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-ai-goblin-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-ai-goblin-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Agentic Memory: Walrus Takes On AI&#39;s Next Big Bottleneck</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365834/agentic-memory-walrus-takes-on-ais-next-big-bottleneck</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 17:31:07 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Long-term memory limits what AI agents can do. Walrus is going after it with MemWal plus new OpenClaw and NemoClaw integrations.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Staff</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365834</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/NemoClaw-2-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/NemoClaw-2-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Crypto Is the Most Muted Topic on Elon Musk’s X, Ahead of Politics: Product Head</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366176/crypto-most-muted-topic-elon-musk-x-product-head</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 17:21:05 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Internal data shows users mute crypto more than politics and global conflict on X’s For You feed.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366176</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/twitter-X-logo-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Technology</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/twitter-X-logo-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Polymarket Launches Market Integrity Tools Following Soldier’s Insider Trading Arrest</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366177/polymarket-launches-market-integrity-tools-following-soldiers-insider-trading-arrest</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 17:11:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The team-up between Polymarket and Chainalysis aims to bring institutional-grade compliance monitoring to crypto prediction markets.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366177</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/decrypt-style-polymarket-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/decrypt-style-polymarket-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>MegaETH Token Launches as Ethereum Layer-2 Network&#39;s Novel Rewards System Is Tested</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366164/megaeth-token-launches-ethereum-layer-2-novel-rewards-system</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 16:26:01 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Ethereum layer-2 network MegaETH will unlock its native MEGA token over time, and reward it to users, as key benchmarks are met.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Sander Lutz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366164</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-07-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n