me day, with Google Cloud up 63% and Microsoft&#39;s AI business hitting a $37 billion run rate.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366100</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/stock-chart-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/stock-chart-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"901\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n  </channel>\n</rss>","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777874599936}}
{"type":"message","id":"3052b2c4","parentId":"c6a1f135","timestamp":"2026-05-04T06:03:30.711Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"We have fetched RSS feed. Now need to extract biggest news event. For simplicity, we could pick the first item (most recent). The biggest event maybe Bitcoin price movement or Ethereum etc. Let's extract fields: title, link, description, maybe primary asset via looking for keywords Bitcoin/Ethereum etc.\n\nWe'll parse using grep/awk or python. Simpler: use grep to find first <item> with title containing \"Bitcoin\" or \"Ethereum\". Let's search.\n\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"<reasoning>Extract first item with Bitcoin in title. Use grep -A5 etc. We'll parse feed to JSON manually? Simpler: use python -c to parse XML via xml.etree.ElementTree and output JSON with needed fields: topic_theme (maybe title), combined_key_facts (list of two key facts: maybe descriptions of first two items), primary asset (detect Bitcoin/Ethereum/etc)."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tooluse_suN69hDBZYnW9HE4A2JFKP","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport sys, xml.etree.ElementTree as ET, json, re\nxml = sys.stdin.read()\nroot = ET.fromstring(xml)\nitems = root.findall('.//item')\n# Find biggest event: choose first item with Bitcoin or Ethereum in title\nprimary = None\nfor it in items:\n    title = it.find('title').text\n    if any(tok in title for tok in ['Bitcoin','Ethereum','Dogecoin','Tether']):\n        primary = it\n        break\nif not primary:\n    primary = items[0]\ntitle = primary.find('title').text\nlink = primary.find('link').text\ndesc = primary.find('description').text\n# Determine primary asset\nasset = None\nfor a in ['Bitcoin','Ethereum','Dogecoin','Tether','XRP']:\n    if a.lower() in title.lower() or a.lower() in desc.lower():\n        asset = a\n        break\nif not asset:\n    asset = 'Crypto'\n# Combined key facts: take descriptions of first two items\nfacts = []\nfor it in items[:2]:\n    d = it.find('description').text\n    facts.append(d.strip())\nresult = {\n    'topic_theme': title,\n    'combined_key_facts': facts,\n    'primary_asset': asset,\n    'article_title': title,\n    'article_link': link,\n    'article_description': desc,\n}\nprint(json.dumps(result))\nPY"}}],"api":"bedrock-converse-stream","provider":"amazon-bedrock","model":"openai.gpt-oss-120b-1:0","usage":{"input":23764,"output":569,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24333,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777874599938}}
