{"type":"message","id":"7b69b195","parentId":"ff9f6065","timestamp":"2026-05-04T06:03:37.423Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The python script expected XML from stdin, but exec didn't pipe the RSS content. We need to feed the RSS content via a file. We saved earlier via curl output; we can pipe via command substitution.\n\nWe have the RSS content printed earlier but not saved. Let's save to a file first: run curl -s > /tmp/feed.xml then parse.\n\n<thinking>Run curl to fetch and save to /tmp/feed.xml, then parse.</thinking>"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tooluse_TWn4l02ks2gxiI8eraWsfu","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s https://decrypt.co/feed > /tmp/feed.xml && python3 - <<'PY'\nimport sys, xml.etree.ElementTree as ET, json\nwith open('/tmp/feed.xml') as f:\n    xml = f.read()\nroot = ET.fromstring(xml)\nitems = root.findall('.//item')\nprimary = None\nfor it in items:\n    title = it.find('title').text or ''\n    if any(tok in title for tok in ['Bitcoin','Ethereum','Dogecoin','Tether']):\n        primary = it\n        break\nif not primary:\n    primary = items[0]\ntitle = primary.find('title').text or ''\nlink = primary.find('link').text or ''\ndesc = primary.find('description').text or ''\nasset = None\nfor a in ['Bitcoin','Ethereum','Dogecoin','Tether','XRP']:\n    if a.lower() in title.lower() or a.lower() in desc.lower():\n        asset = a\n        break\nif not asset:\n    asset = 'Crypto'\nfacts = []\nfor it in items[:2]:\n    d = it.find('description').text or ''\n    facts.append(d.strip())\nresult = {\n    'topic_theme': title,\n    'combined_key_facts': facts,\n    'primary_asset': asset,\n    'article_title': title,\n    'article_link': link,\n    'article_description': desc,\n}\nprint(json.dumps(result))\nPY"}}],"api":"bedrock-converse-stream","provider":"amazon-bedrock","model":"openai.gpt-oss-120b-1:0","usage":{"input":24395,"output":454,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24849,"cost":{"input":0,"outp